# "Verse" in C major: chords I ii7 V7 vi, a bass with M3, M6, M7 and the chromatic A4, a beat on a MIDI note track. The second entry is to play it in A minor.
song "Other mode"

track "Clock"
  type clock_and_transport

track "Keys"
  type poly_voice
  notes pitched
  clef treble
  lead

track "Bass"
  type mono_voice
  notes pitched
  clef bass

