section "Verse"  key C major  meter 4/4
  line "Keys"  | I:q ii7 V7 vi |
  line "Bass"  tonic_octave 2  | P1:e M3 P5 M6 M7 A4 P5 P1 |
  line "Beat"  | C4:q> / / / |

song_composition
